qualityObjective.en:
Classify deficiencies consistently so priority, escalation, responsibility and closure effort match the actual significance of the issue.
The exact categories should follow CRT's system.
A generic framework could distinguish:
cosmetic/minor;
workmanship;
incomplete work;
functional;
safety/life-safety;
technical/non-conforming;
documentation;
commissioning;
turnover-blocking.
Do not impose these labels if CRT uses different terminology.
